@baseUrl = http://localhost:8888
@accessToken = 로그인후_붙여넣기

### 회원가입 (최초 1회)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reactlab",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "리액트연습"
}

### 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reactlab",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 내 정보 (Step 4)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 게시글 목록 (Step 1 — 토큰 불필요)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?page=1&size=20

### 게시글 상세 (Step 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1

### 게시글 등록 (Step 7 — C)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "리액트에서 쓴 글",
  "content": "CRUD 연습"
}

### 게시글 수정 (Step 8 — U)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "수정된 제목",
  "content": "수정된 내용"
}

### 게시글 삭제 (Step 9 — D)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 댓글 등록 (Step 10 보너스)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "bno": 1,
  "content": "댓글 CRUD 연습"
}
